春花を助けているのを目撃し、「不公平だから、自分も助けてもらう権利がある」と強引に司の部屋に乗り込んでくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その後、行き場を失い高屋敷家に集まった面々に「家族計画」を提案する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見からは解りにくいが正気を失っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"従軍経験があり、高屋敷家に乗り込んできた中国人マフィア5名を無力化させる程の実力者でもある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父親役。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1859","sourceWorkId":"19430","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"实力超群的企业战士。家族计划中的父亲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"相当古怪的人，用自己奇特的言行和荒诞的行动力把周遭人都卷进事件中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"司的天敌。“原企业战士”的头衔可不是随便说说的，不但精通各种战斗技巧，而且还身负各种五花八门的技能(比如一拳打烂了电线杆什么的……)。有着十分复杂的过去……？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20737"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ca/caca139b89af134be2181c6f61d1fefa6e424aa098b36310ee59edb7cca331a3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8cdbf5de086e44aa31ed4a8c290c4d8f9847f0456be449e42869855751ea4429.webp","width":108,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"若本規夫","creatorId":"vndb:s8","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s8","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s8","name":"若本 規夫","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:4347:20737:3920:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"四宮豪","creatorId":"vndb:s732","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s732","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s732","name":"四宮 豪","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:80947:20737:4860:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7469","characterName":"劉 家輝","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20742","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"4347"},{"characterId":"20742","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"80947"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1860"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7469"},"originalCharacterName":"劉 家輝","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","sta